==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head={{l|en|solar}} {{l|en|day}}}}

# {{astronomy}} one [[day]] of [[solar time]], the time between [[successive]] [[noon]]s; the time in which a planet such as [[Earth]] rotates once around its [[axis]], relative to the [[sun]] (on Earth about 24 hours as an average - the length of solar day is not constant throughout the year)

